message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Proprioceptive stability control for a 1:10-scale vehicle"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and plan of a study on low-cost proprioceptive stability control
  (IMU and encoder) for a 1:10-scale vehicle, with a Simplex-style safety layer
  towards shared autonomy.
authors:
